{
  "chapter": 64,
  "title": "Footwear, gaiters and the like; parts of such articles",
  "notes": "This chapter covers footwear of all types. Classification depends primarily on the material of the outer sole and the upper. Waterproof footwear (heading 6401) requires that neither the sole nor the upper have any stitching, riveting, nailing or similar assembly that would allow water penetration.",
  "headings": [
